# Ghostty's GTK window on Dolly's X server, with Slop in it: the Xsdl server
# takes the display, and Ghostty draws its terminal with Mesa's OpenGL
# (softpipe through EGL, OpenGL 4.3 as Ghostty asks) and its window's
# widgets with cairo. GTK's text is fontconfig's, from the terminal's font.
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-core 7205c35aed897514d3094f14a194669f73c295b4dd0213619d90155da8467cde
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-posix 50b5060f38addea1f5eca4b3a5afdbc976335da59d74d08b08aeb725637804ca
INSTALL /v0.1.5/Dollyfile-display 656b938d470bb5b42aae1ef4b39382e86755a65726fdb1be20c7b20b3e014694
INSTALL /v0.1.5/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server a503f0481d01638b7486ee82b9e2a790da0184864608fb772c6b6b9ddb4062bc
INSTALL /v0.1.5/demos/ghostty-gtk/Dollyfile-ghostty-gtk 5f96fa283f1f70647987943e938c35efb57089268b3461047c02d3522b608bf6
